{1}{Ahhhhh!!!!  Yes!!!!  My flesh is restored!!! [The man before you laughs, ominously.]  I'd forgotten the pleasures, the feelings, the rush of blood running through my veins.  It's ecstasy...!}{Ahhhhh!!!!  Yes!!!!  My flesh is restored!!! [The man before you laughs, ominously.]  I'd forgotten the pleasures, the feelings, the rush of blood running through my veins.  It's ecstasy...!}{}{1}{}{}
{2}{Who are you?}{}{5}{}{5}{}
{3}{Uh...who you?}{}{-4}{}{5}{}
{5}{[He looks at you, surprised, as if he's forgotten that you were there.]  Me?  I am Torian Kel, Warlord in the Gray Legions of the Derian-Ka.  [He looks around, at both you and the surrounding temple.]  How many years has it been...?  All of this, and you...so unfamiliar...}{Me?  I am Torian Kel, Warlord in the Gray Legions of the Derian-Ka.  [He looks around, at both you and the surrounding temple.]  How many years has it been...?  All of this, and you...so unfamiliar...}{}{2}{}{}
{6}{I don't know...how long were you like that?}{}{5}{}{9}{}
{7}{How long you skeleton...?}{}{-4}{}{9}{}
{9}{I...I don't know.  I was a warrior, raised from the grave to serve in the undead legions of the Derian-Ka.  We fought a great battle with the...what was it?...So many years ago, and I am all that is left...[A great sorrow passes over his features.]  Alone, so alone...}{I...I don't know.  I was a warrior, raised from the grave to serve in the undead legions of the Derian-Ka.  We fought a great battle with the...what was it?...So many years ago, and I am all that is left...[A great sorrow passes over his features.]  Alone, so alone...}{}{3}{}{}
