{113}{This was the greatest temple of the Derian-Ka.  When the battle between the Gray Legion and the Molochean Hand was over, we returned here, hoping to find our masters.  They never returned...}{This was the greatest temple of the Derian-Ka.  When the battle between the Gray Legion and the Molochean Hand was over, we returned here, hoping to find our masters.  They never returned...}{}{21}{}{}
