{117}{Now?  I don't know...I don't belong here...it seems nothing like the world that I remember.  All I know is war and death...even after all of these centuries, I still feel the bloodlust, the need for battle.  But mostly, I wish to free my remaining companions as I have been freed.  Perhaps  I will try to find the means to do so...}{Now?  I don't know...I don't belong here...it seems nothing like the world that I remember.  All I know is war and death...even after all of these centuries, I still feel the bloodlust, the need for battle.  But mostly, I wish to free my remaining companions as I have been freed.  Perhaps  I will try to find the means to do so...}{}{22}{}{}
