{313}{I've never set my eyes on this place before, but I have heard tales of it...the memories of life...I once had an elven mistress, I still remember her face as I left her to fight in the battle that would take my life.}{I've never set my eyes on this place before, but I have heard tales of it...the memories of life...I once had an elven mistress, I still remember her face as I left her to fight in the battle that would take my life.}{}{42}{}{}
